language 0.1.0
module ui
  means
    The user interface: the presentations, controls, actions, navigation and
    layout available to a user.

entity screen : thing
  means
    screen: an addressable area of the user interface presenting the user with
    a coherent context of interaction.

entity view : thing
  means
    view: a visual or other user-facing projection of data, leaving the
    identity of the projected data unchanged.

entity control : thing
  means
    control: an interactive element of the interface through which a user
    enters data or initiates an action.

entity action : thing
  means
    action: a semantically meaningful operation initiated through the user
    interface.

entity navigation : thing
  means
    navigation: a change of the current interface context from one screen or
    view to another.

entity platform : thing
  means
    platform: a class of user environment determining the available means of
    display and input.

entity layout : thing
  means
    layout: the rules of spatial arrangement of interface elements.
